					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿提亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670804,
					"content": "艾登、卡里瑪，妳們可要記好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿提亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670805,
					"content": "遇見危險的情況絕對不要逞強，需要撤退的時候，一定要果斷撤退才行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿提亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670806,
					"content": "特別是妳，艾登。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿提亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670807,
					"content": "我知道啦——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾登"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670808,
					"content": "很好，那我們下一步…就去村外，讓妳們親眼見識一下「戰鬥」的場面吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿提亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670809,
					"content": "好耶！爸爸剛給我削了一根木劍，我就帶在身上。卡里瑪，妳呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾登"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670810,
					"content": "我倒是有一把小弓箭，雖然…媽媽只給我沒有箭頭的箭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡里瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670811,
					"content": "哈哈哈！沒問題，妳們又有劍又有弓，而且還有滿滿的勇氣，這些就足夠妳們踏上冒險之路了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿提亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670812,
					"content": "但是，去了村外之後記得不要亂跑，要時時刻刻待在我和旅行者身邊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670813,
						732670814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿提亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670813,
					"content": "你真要帶他們出去？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670815
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732670815,
					"content": "…放心吧，那個地方我已經事先踩點過了，只有幾隻病懨懨的蠍子，幾乎沒有攻擊性，不會有問題的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿提亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670816,
					"content": "再說了，不是還有我們在嘛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670817,
						732670818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿提亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670817,
					"content": "你就這樣把我算進來了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732670819,
					"content": "#…都到這裡了，好人做到底啦旅行者。我也會按照冒險家的規矩，準備好報酬給{F#妳}{M#你}的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿提亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670820,
					"content": "那妳們兩個準備好，我們這就出發了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿提亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670821,
					"content": "喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾登"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670822,
					"content": "唔…有點緊張…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卡里瑪"
				},
				{
					"id": 732670818,
					"content": "我答應你什麼了嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732670814,
					"content": "帶著兩個孩子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732670815
					]
				}
			]
		},
